Minimal Frost — a layout for Herdr.

The mods in mods/frost-* are modified copies of mods shipped with Herdr
(version 0.1.16), which are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Each mod.json records the Herdr mod it was copied from under "cloned_from";
the changes made to each are listed in RECIPE.md under "Built from".
layouts/minimal-frost.json is derived from Herdr's "main" layout.

